sequenceDiagram
  participant W as Workflow
  participant C as Context/Policy
  participant R as Routing Agent
  participant B as Budget/Audit
  participant G as LLM Gateway
  participant P as Provider
  W->>C: TaskNeed + pinned versions
  C->>C: Data, capability, identity and qualification filters
  C->>R: Eligible IDs + permitted evidence summaries
  R-->>C: Selected ID + reasons + alternatives
  C->>C: Validate selection and required review pair
  C->>B: Atomic reservation and RoutingDecision
  B-->>C: Authorized execution context
  C->>G: Exact deployment + authorized context
  G->>P: Provider-specific request
  P-->>G: Result / refusal / uncertain outcome
  G->>B: Usage, effective model identity, invocation journal
  G-->>W: Typed result and evidence references
  Note over C,G: No invisible model substitution; technical failover re-enters selection.
